# Student Performance Predictor with Fuzzy Logic

## Overview
A full-stack application that predicts student performance using fuzzy logic.

## Features
- Fuzzy logic prediction engine
- Web interface (HTML/CSS/JS)
- Python backend with Flask
- Desktop GUI application

## How to Run
```bash
# Install dependencies
pip install flask numpy scikit-fuzzy pandas

# Run web version
python backend/app.py

# Run desktop version  
python student_performance_gui.py
```

## Project Structure
- `backend/` - Python backend code
- `frontend/` - Web interface
- `*.py` - Main application files

